<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid #CED4DA;padding-top:6px;font-size:10px;color:#6C757D"><span>Reporting period: {{ rows[0].values.`Period Start`.formatted }} – {{ rows[0].values.`Period End`.formatted }} &nbsp;·&nbsp; Net of Cancelled and Returned items</span><span>Page 2 of 5</span></div>
